---
// Gerbang zoom-through (motion A): kata SYARAT raksasa jadi pintu ke Kamus.
---
<section id="sg-gate" class="relative overflow-hidden grid place-items-center" style="min-height:110svh;background:var(--aw-color-bg-page)" aria-label="Gerbang syarat">
  <p class="sg-xs font-extrabold uppercase absolute top-10" style="letter-spacing:.2em">scroll terus, Dek — kita masuk ke mesinnya</p>
  <div id="sg-gate-word" class="sg-gate-word text-center select-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <p class="sg-display" style="font-size:clamp(4rem,22vw,16rem)">SYARAT</p>
    <p class="sg-stampfont" style="font-size:var(--fs-md);letter-spacing:.3em;color:var(--aw-color-primary)">MASUK</p>
  </div>
  <p class="sg-body absolute bottom-10 max-w-md text-center px-6">Di balik kata ini: kamus 15 istilah syarat lomba yang paling sering bikin peserta gugur.</p>
</section>
